<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">Dear Future Sun Devil,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for expressing interest in the <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/latin-american-studies-degree">Latin American Studies (BA)</a> program at Arizona State University. This program lets students immerse themselves in content courses while honing their language skills, and it provides a broad foundation for students to study Latin America, the United States and the Iberian Peninsula. One can choose from five tracks: the arts; narrative (literature and film); history and political science; education and linguistics; sociology and anthropology. Students usually look to work as Business managers, Entrepreneurs, Human Resources Specialists, in International Business, Legal professions, Medical professions, and in the ministry among many other areas. By viewing the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/roadmaps/ASU00/ASLASBA/null/ALL/2016">major map</a>, you can see the degree requirements outlined for graduation.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Be sure to review our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/requirements">admission and application requirements</a> for more information about the application process in an easy to follow format. For information on how to pay for college, please visit our <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/college-scholarships">scholarships</a> page.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">It's important to find the right fit for your undergraduate program. A great way to learn more about this degree is to register for one of our upcoming information sessions. You can <a href="https://visit.asu.edu/">visit ASU</a> and register for a tour.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We can’t wait to see you here at West campus! If you have any questions about New College, West campus, or one of our 35 programs, please contact our Recruitment Office through the information listed below. Thank you, and we’ll talk to you soon!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Kindest Regards</b>,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">New College Recruitment Team</font></div><div><font face="arial">New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#990000">Arizona State University, West campus</font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="mailto:asknewcollege@asu.edu">asknewcollege@asu.edu</a>&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">602-543-2890</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>